  </item>
  <item>
    <title>E06.北京中产困境，买学区房还是上国际学校？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64ef44cce490c5dee5e59681</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64ef44cce490c5dee5e59681</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 31 Aug 2023 11:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【内容简介】</span></p><span></span><p><span>中产作死五件套：高杠杆买房、孩子读国际学校、老婆不上班、自己掏钱创业、梭哈股票和基金。有了孩子以后你的北京中产地位还保得住吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间线轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="53">00:53</a> 我们口中的北京中产</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="169">02:49</a> 年收入500万的“中产”上国际学校的悲剧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="560">09:20</a> 北京朝阳上公立学校的入学顺位</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="774">12:54</a> 对于能上国际学校的，学区房是保底选项</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1043">17:23</a> 认房不认贷真能实施吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1135">18:55</a> 家长躺平了，孩子长大后会怨我们吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1214">20:14</a> 中产作死五件套之首：高杠杆买房</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1726">28:46</a> 买学区房就等于省了国际学校学费</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1796">29:56</a> 去西城买个厕所凑学区</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1900">31:40</a> 公立学校国际部考虑下？</span></p><span></span><p><span>（本期音乐：夏天的夜 ft. BCD Studio）&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播介绍】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Xin妈，孩子才两个月就考虑幼升小的鸡娃妈妈</span></p><span></span><p><span>Xin爸，口中说着不内卷但用脚投票的老爹</span></p><span></span><p><span>Xinxin，走路都还不会命运就被安排的宝宝</span></p><span></span><p><span>【群互动】</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们建群啦，欢迎加群互动！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FldLJFwfFj9FEgrrhN3CK10zYce1.JPG"></figure><span></span><p></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ls-30TESKwFJYUTvOdS-WeroOAIk.m4a" length="36414065" type="audio/mp4"/>
