  <item>
    <title>E05.豆腐脑 vs 豆腐花？| 南北差异大比拼</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64e736a7e490c5dee559e2b4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64e736a7e490c5dee559e2b4</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 24 Aug 2023 10:53:25 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【内容简介】</span></p><span></span><p><span>有句成语叫做“南橘北枳”，一条淮河就可以将同种作物分为两种，那相距几千里的北方人和南方人组成的家庭中又会有多大的差异呢？北方人会接受肉粽子吗？南方人吃的惯豆腐脑吗？南方人看春晚吗？我们今天邀请到另一对南北家庭和我们一起聊聊南北的差异。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间线轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="183">03:03</a> 广东以外都是北方人？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="430">07:10</a> 豆腐脑应该是甜的还是咸的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="505">08:25</a> 北方人能接受肉粽子吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="799">13:19</a> 南方人吃饺子吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="956">15:56</a> 南方人春晚的替代品是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1218">20:18</a> 南北方的红包可不是一种红包</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1704">28:24</a> 二婚的婚礼是该中午还是晚上办？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1984">33:04</a> 广东人的“奶奶”是“妈妈”？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2063">34:23</a> 还有人没事儿去墓地跑步？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2408">40:08</a> 如果找不到北，北方人还能找到路吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2680">44:40</a> 南方人一次买两只鸡蛋？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2862">47:42</a> 南北方蟑螂大PK（勿入）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3147">52:27</a> 北方人为啥张口闭口都是国际大事，而南方人更喜欢吃喝玩乐？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3276">54:36</a> 南北方生育养儿的异同</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4209">70:09</a> 多语种环境中，孩子应该怎样适应？&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>（本期音乐：Annen Polka ft. Drafi Frantisek）&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播介绍】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Xin妈，分不清东西南北的广东女仔</span></p><span></span><p><span>Xin爸，不理解豆腐花的北方“大汉”</span></p><span></span><p><span>Milton妈，“身在曹营心在汉”的北方辣妈</span></p><span></span><p><span>Milton爸，喜好逛夜市但不划龙舟的广东男仔</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/luzIJ52-0W9jhlcijVHtL7Akk3zl.m4a" length="78161824" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:20:32</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZqcFFIT0xkTlk5Y2JnYjJCRGZJUmZLUUdQYVAucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>E04.养育男孩系列之一：那些“养废”的儿子</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64dcc929e490c5dee59fcccc</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64dcc929e490c5dee59fcccc</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 17 Aug 2023 11:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【内容简介】</span></p><span></span><p><span>“子不孝，父之过。教不严，师之惰。子不学，非所宜。幼不学，老何为。”</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-《三字经》</span></p><span></span><p><span>恋爱脑、妈宝男、油腻男、霸凌者和其他那些被“养废”的儿子们，你更不能接受那种？</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间线轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="140">02:20</a> 富二代从恋爱脑到海王的“蜕变”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="260">04:20</a> 印有前女友名字的纹身该怎么处理？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="445">07:25</a> 痴情男定制秀恩爱车牌后的下场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="615">10:15</a> 汪某菲是最大的“妈宝男”？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="850">14:10</a> 你见过给女生送盆栽的吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1020">17:00</a> 去教会不会让你更接近上帝，但会吃到免费的“午餐”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1112">18:32</a> Xin爸以一己之力拯救硅谷华人女性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1355">22:35</a> 霸凌者比被霸凌者更容易成功？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1515">25:15</a> 当今社会不看存量，看增量</span></p><span></span><p><span>（本期音乐：Promising Future ft. GrossTheGalaxy）&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播介绍】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Xin妈，极力避免“妈宝男”儿子的妈妈</span></p><span></span><p><span>Xin爸，介于养废和没废之间的上一代成品</span></p><span></span><p><span>Xinxin，万众期待及“精心培养”的试验品</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lvi8eTT4KgIqhLB5w3v2JfxC25ER.m4a" length="27014379" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:27:50</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZpRG1mbzVROFNJRThPc2x4MUJJUW90aWg4Vm8ucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>E03.为什么不让老人带娃？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64d358cbe490c5dee5f98f64</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64d358cbe490c5dee5f98f64</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 10 Aug 2023 11:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【内容简介】</span></p><span></span><p><span>"To be in your children's memories tomorrow, you have to be in their lives today."</span></p><span></span><p><span>- Barbara Johnson</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果把育儿当做长期投资，那么资产的升值与贬值完全取决于投后管理；谁才是更合适的管理者？</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间线轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="102">01:42</a> 孩子父母比老人更适宜培养孩子的健全人格</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="126">02:06</a> 父母的养育帮助孩子”安全依恋“的形成</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="198">03:18</a> 大壮、小美家婆媳关系的故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="345">05:45</a> 孩子“安全依恋”的形成过程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="395">06:35</a> 你的另一半是“不安全依恋”吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="555">09:15</a> 老人更关注孩子饿不饿，而不是孩子的情绪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="601">10:01</a> 孩子情绪的形成过程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="703">11:43</a> Xinxin的愤怒</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="841">14:01</a> 孩子谁带，就和谁亲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1070">17:50</a> 孩子应不应该穿袜子？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1286">21:26</a> 如果孩子出现状况，家庭关系如何处理？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1472">24:32</a> 家和万事兴</span></p><span></span><p><span>（本期音乐：Fresh ft. BCD Studio）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播介绍】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Xin妈，担心孩子和自己不亲的宠娃狂魔</span></p><span></span><p><span>Xin爸，发展心理学理论带娃的实践者</span></p><span></span><p><span>Xinxin，老人“想玩不想看（kān）”的大孙子</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lhetcopxY9G_T2PCXVa5ueKyDLfP.m4a" length="25371003" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:26:08</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZpRG1mbzVROFNJRThPc2x4MUJJUW90aWg4Vm8ucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>E02.生娃后，你后悔了吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64c9ae0f99e1e7669e9dcb5e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64c9ae0f99e1e7669e9dcb5e</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 03 Aug 2023 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【内容简介】</span></p><span></span><p><span>芒格说，幸福的真谛有5个要点：量入为出、精明投资、延迟满足、远离烂人和终身成长。</span></p><span></span><p><span>生娃既让人远离过度消费、也让人重视取友必端、还让人理解了延迟满足、学会了终身成长，至于是不是精明的投资，那至少得等18年后了，所以广大的父母们，你们幸福吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间线轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="45">00:45</a> 父母在生孩子后会瞬间进入角色吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="168">02:48</a> 生娃后失去自由</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="292">04:52</a> 孩子会带来夫妻间的争吵吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="468">07:48</a> 怎么做到在孩子面前不吵架？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="618">10:18</a> 生娃会使妈妈焦虑吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="679">11:19</a> 命里有时终须有、命里无时靠老豆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="794">13:14</a> 生娃之后，你后悔了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="872">14:32</a> 生娃是为了摆脱无聊？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1062">17:42</a> 通过生娃，重过自己的人生</span></p><span></span><p><span>（本期音乐：Gone with the Wind ft. Julie London）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播介绍】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Xin妈，生娃为摆脱无聊的switch游戏玩家</span></p><span></span><p><span>Xin爸，制造问题的问题解决者</span></p><span></span><p><span>Xinxin，观察爸妈“吵架”的吃瓜群众</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lqnPQgR05Q9Ki6oVlv10nRKQ7Z9O.m4a" length="20701155" type="audio/mp4"/>
