  <item>
    <title>E01.生娃究竟是科学设计还是玄学碰运气？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64c0b53399e1e7669e0c87e8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64c0b53399e1e7669e0c87e8</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 27 Jul 2023 11:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【内容简介】</span></p><span></span><p><span>佛说：“前世一千次的回眸，换来今世的一次擦肩而过”，孩子的出生是前世因果的延续。</span></p><span></span><p><span>上帝说：“儿女是耶和华所赐的产业，所怀的胎是他所给的赏赐”（诗 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7623">127:3</a>）。</span></p><span></span><p><span>现代科学说：孩子是受精卵发育的结果。</span></p><span></span><p><span>村口的大爷大妈说：养儿防老，积谷防饥。</span></p><span></span><p><span>所以生娃究竟是科学设计还是玄学碰运气？</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间线轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="38">00:38</a> Xinxin是excel表格计算出来的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="161">02:41</a> 早一年还是晚一年上学好？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="295">04:55</a> Xin爸被霸凌的惨痛经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="370">06:10</a> 为什么冰球明星大都是1月份或2月份出生？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="530">08:50</a> 居无定所能生娃吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="670">11:10</a> 初入职场的律师有条件生娃吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="820">13:40</a> 资深互联网人生娃前的谋划</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="875">14:35</a> 生娃前心态要稳</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="980">16:20</a> 来自Xin妈对“excel生娃”的嫌弃</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1135">18:55</a> 生二胎还用excel？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1177">19:37</a> 生娃既是设计也要靠玄学</span></p><span></span><p><span>（本期音乐：Laird Baird ft. Charlie Parker）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播介绍】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Xin妈：偏爱虎宝宝的随性分子</span></p><span></span><p><span>Xin爸：“excel生娃”的理性执念者</span></p><span></span><p><span>Xinxin：算法计算出生的宝宝</span></p>]]></description>
